<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Nov 08 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper down 7775, tin down 125, lead down 900, zinc down 375, aluminium up 2650, nickel up 174, aluminium alloy down 240</p>
